<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tool Trích Xuất KQXN</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/2.16.105/pdf.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.23.0/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.23.0/firebase-database-compat.js"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb; --primary-hover: #1d4ed8; --primary-light: #eff6ff;
            --bg-body: #f9fafb; --bg-card: #ffffff; --bg-subtle: #f3f4f6;
            --text-main: #111827; --text-secondary: #4b5563; --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border: #e5e7eb; --border-light: #f3f4f6;
            --success: #10b981; --success-bg: #ecfdf5; --danger: #ef4444; --danger-bg: #fef2f2;
            
            /* Table colors */
            --table-stripe: #FAFAFA;
            --table-hover: #F4F4F5;
            
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
            --shadow-drawer: -4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        body.dark-mode {
            --primary: #3b82f6; --primary-hover: #60a5fa; --primary-light: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            --bg-body: #0f172a; --bg-card: #1e293b; --bg-subtle: #334155;
            --text-main: #f8fafc; --text-secondary: #cbd5e1; --text-muted: #64748b;
            --border: #334155; --border-light: #1e293b;
            --success: #10b981; --success-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); --danger: #f87171; --danger-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            --table-stripe: #0f1523; --table-hover: #1e293b;
            --shadow-drawer: -4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-body); color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow: hidden; /* Prevent body scroll, handle in main */
        }

        .svg-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; fill: none; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .svg-icon-sm { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
        .svg-icon-lg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }

        /* ================= HEADER ================= */
        .top-navbar {
            height: 56px; background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 40;
        }
        .brand-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .brand-logo {
            width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--text-main); color: var(--bg-card);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .brand-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
        
        .header-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .btn-icon {
            background: transparent; border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--text-secondary); width: 36px; height: 36px;
            border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; display: flex;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.15s;
            position: relative;
        }
        .btn-icon:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); color: var(--text-main); }
        .btn-icon.active { background: var(--bg-subtle); color: var(--primary); border-color: var(--border); }
        
        /* Tooltip CSS */
        [data-tooltip]::after {
            content: attr(data-tooltip); position: absolute; top: 100%; right: 50%; transform: translateX(50%);
            background: var(--text-main); color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
            white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: all 0.2s; margin-top: 6px; z-index: 100;
        }
        [data-tooltip]:hover::after { opacity: 1; margin-top: 4px; }

        /* ================= MAIN WORKSPACE ================= */
        .main-workspace {
            flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            width: 100%; max-width: 1600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* --- STATE 1: UPLOAD HERO (Lớn) --- */
        .upload-hero-container {
            flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out;
        }
        .upload-hero {
            width: 100%; max-width: 640px;
            border: 2px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 64px 32px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s; background: var(--bg-card);
            position: relative;
        }
        .upload-hero:hover, .upload-hero.dragover { border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-light); }
        .upload-hero input[type="file"] { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; }
        .upload-icon-wrap {
            width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg-subtle);
            color: var(--text-secondary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto; transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .upload-hero:hover .upload-icon-wrap { transform: translateY(-4px); color: var(--primary); background: var(--bg-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
        .upload-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text-main); }
        .upload-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* --- STATE 2: DATA WORKSPACE --- */
        .data-workspace {
            flex: 1; display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out; height: 100%;
        }
        .data-workspace.active { display: flex; }

        /* Toolbar */
        .toolbar {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .toolbar-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .toolbar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        
        .btn-upload-sm {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-main); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
            position: relative; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }
        .btn-upload-sm:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); border-color: var(--text-muted); }
        .btn-upload-sm input { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; }

        .stat-pill {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--bg-subtle);
            border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 500;
        }
        .stat-pill b { color: var(--text-main); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
            background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-main); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); border-color: var(--primary-hover); }
        .btn-icon-only { padding: 8px; width: 36px; height: 36px; justify-content: center; position: relative; }
        .btn-icon-only.danger:hover { color: var(--danger); border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); background: var(--danger-bg); }

        /* Split Button */
        .split-btn { display: flex; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
        .split-btn > button {
            border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-main); padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
        }
        .split-btn > button:first-child { border-top-left-radius: 8px; border-bottom-left-radius: 8px; border-right: none; }
        .split-btn > button:last-child { border-top-right-radius: 8px; border-bottom-right-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; }
        .split-btn > button:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); }
        .split-btn .primary-action { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; }
        .split-btn .primary-action:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); border-color: var(--primary-hover); }
        
        .dropdown-menu {
            position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 4px); right: 0;
            background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); padding: 4px;
            min-width: 160px; display: none; flex-direction: column; z-index: 50;
        }
        .dropdown-menu.show { display: flex; }
        .dropdown-item {
            padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-main); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        }
        .dropdown-item:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); }

        /* ================= TABLE ================= */
        .table-container {
            flex: 1; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px; overflow: auto; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--border) transparent;
        }
        .table-container::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
        .table-container::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; }

        table.data-table {
            width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0;
            text-align: left; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        /* Header tầng 1: Nhóm */
        table.data-table thead tr.tier-group th {
            background: var(--bg-card); padding: 12px 16px;
            font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cat-group-title { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .color-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
        .dot-hanh-chinh { background: #3b82f6; }
        .dot-huyet-hoc { background: #ef4444; }
        .dot-hoa-sinh { background: #10b981; }
        .dot-nuoc-tieu { background: #f59e0b; }
        .dot-vi-sinh { background: #8b5cf6; }
        .dot-khac { background: #6b7280; }

        /* Header tầng 2: Tên chỉ số */
        table.data-table thead tr.tier-indicator th {
            background: var(--bg-card); padding: 12px 16px;
            font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky; top: 41px; z-index: 19;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Body */
        table.data-table td {
            padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            transition: background 0.1s;
        }
        table.data-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background-color: var(--table-stripe); }
        table.data-table tbody tr:hover td { background-color: var(--table-hover); }
        
        /* Cột đầu tiên (Tên BN) */
        table.data-table th:first-child, table.data-table td:first-child {
            position: sticky; left: 0; background: var(--bg-card);
            z-index: 21; text-align: left; font-weight: 600;
            min-width: 200px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        table.data-table thead tr.tier-indicator th:first-child { z-index: 25; }
        table.data-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td:first-child { background: var(--table-stripe); }
        table.data-table tbody tr:hover td:first-child { background: var(--table-hover); }

        /* Ô dữ liệu số */
        table.data-table td.col-data {
            text-align: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px;
        }
        table.data-table td[contenteditable="true"]:hover { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border); }
        table.data-table td[contenteditable="true"]:focus {
            outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--primary);
            background: var(--bg-card) !important; z-index: 30; position: relative;
        }

        /* Empty state table (khi chưa chọn cột) */
        .empty-table { text-align: center; padding: 64px 20px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }

        /* ================= DRAWERS (Off-canvas) ================= */
        .drawer-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px); z-index: 100;
            opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        .drawer-overlay.active { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
        
        .drawer {
            position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            width: 420px; max-width: 100vw; background: var(--bg-card);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-drawer); z-index: 101;
            transform: translateX(100%); transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }
        .drawer.active { transform: translateX(0); }

        .drawer-header {
            padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .drawer-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .drawer-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .drawer-footer {
            padding: 16px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--bg-subtle); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* --- Drawer Lịch sử --- */
        .history-list { padding: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
        .history-item {
            padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; transition: all 0.15s;
        }
        .history-item:hover { border-color: var(--text-muted); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
        .history-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
        .history-time { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }
        .history-count { background: var(--bg-subtle); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono'; }
        .history-patients { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
        .patient-chip { font-size: 12px; background: var(--bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .history-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 4px; }
        .history-actions .btn { padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12px; }

        /* --- Drawer Chọn chỉ số --- */
        .search-wrap { padding: 12px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .search-input {
            width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px 8px 32px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg-subtle); color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px;
        }
        .search-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--bg-card); }
        .search-icon-pos { position: absolute; left: 30px; top: 22px; color: var(--text-muted); pointer-events: none; }
        
        .settings-list { padding: 8px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
        .setting-cat-title {
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 12px 8px 4px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
        }
        .setting-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.1s;
        }
        .setting-item:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); }
        .setting-item input[type="checkbox"] {
            width: 16px; height: 16px; accent-color: var(--primary); cursor: pointer;
        }
        .setting-label { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-main); flex: 1; }
        .setting-sample { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

        /* Modals */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); z-index: 1000;
            display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 16px;
        }
        .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }
        .modal-box {
            background: var(--bg-card); width: 100%; max-width: 800px;
            border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-height: 85vh;
        }
        .modal-header { padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .modal-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; }
        .modal-footer { padding: 16px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; background: var(--bg-subtle); border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; }
        
        .preview-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
        .preview-table th { padding: 10px 16px; background: var(--bg-subtle); text-align: left; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); position: sticky; top: 0; }
        .preview-table td { padding: 10px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); }

        /* Toast */
        #toast {
            visibility: hidden; min-width: 250px; max-width: 350px;
            background: #0f172a; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px;
            position: fixed; z-index: 9999; top: 24px; right: 24px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px);
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); pointer-events: none;
        }
        body.dark-mode #toast { background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
        #toast.show { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .toolbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
            .toolbar-left, .toolbar-right { justify-content: space-between; }
            .drawer { width: 100%; }
            .upload-hero { padding: 40px 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="top-navbar">
        <div class="brand-wrap">
            <div class="brand-logo">
                <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="brand-title">KQXN Extractor</div>
        </div>
        <div class="header-controls">
            <button class="btn-icon" id="historyToggleBtn" onclick="toggleHistoryDrawer()" data-tooltip="Lịch sử lưu">
                <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-icon" id="darkModeToggle" onclick="toggleDarkMode()" data-tooltip="Giao diện Sáng/Tối">
                <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path></svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN WORKSPACE -->
    <main class="main-workspace">
        
        <!-- STATE 1: UPLOAD LỚN -->
        <div class="upload-hero-container" id="uploadHeroContainer">
            <div class="upload-hero" id="dropZoneHero">
                <input type="file" id="pdfFileInputHero" accept=".pdf" multiple>
                <div class="upload-icon-wrap">
                    <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"></line></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="upload-title">Tải lên kết quả xét nghiệm</div>
                <div class="upload-sub">Kéo thả các tệp PDF vào đây, hoặc bấm để chọn. Hệ thống sẽ tự động trích xuất và chuẩn hóa dữ liệu.</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STATE 2: DATA VIEW -->
        <div class="data-workspace" id="dataWorkspace">
            
            <!-- Toolbar -->
            <div class="toolbar">
                <div class="toolbar-left">
                    <label class="btn-upload-sm" data-tooltip="Thêm PDF nối tiếp">
                        <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"></line></svg>
                        <span>Thêm PDF</span>
                        <input type="file" id="pdfFileInputCompact" accept=".pdf" multiple>
                    </label>

                    <button type="button" class="btn" id="statusPillBtn" onclick="toggleFileDrawer()" style="display: none;">
                        <svg class="svg-icon svg-icon-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                        <span id="progressText">Đang xử lý...</span>
                    </button>

                    <div class="stat-pill"><span>Bệnh nhân:</span><b id="statPatientsCount">0</b></div>
                    <div class="stat-pill"><span>Chỉ số:</span><b id="statColumnsCount">0/0</b></div>
                </div>

                <div class="toolbar-right">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="toggleColumnDrawer()">
